{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>FunSchulte 把經典 Schulte Table 訓練帶到 iPhone 與 iPad，讓使用者按順序尋找數字，以短時間練習視覺掃描、專注力與數字辨識，適合想在空檔進行短暫視覺搜尋挑戰的人。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-196.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多種格網與練習模式</h2>\n<p>內建 3×3、4×4、5×5、6×6 及 7×7 格網，讓使用者由小型表格開始，再逐步挑戰更大範圍的視覺搜尋。另有 Light 與 Classic 兩種模式可切換；每局會記錄完成時間，方便重看先前成績並比較個人最佳。App 亦支援 Game Center 排行榜、調整表格外觀，以及以每日挑戰維持練習節奏。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-161-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-162-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-163-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-164-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-165-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-166-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：FunSchulte: Schulte Table</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/funschulte-schulte-table/id1544489231?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T23:32:38.591831+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T23:08:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:37.974349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T23:25:54.047043+00:00","content_hash":"dc7c325aaa9b4d552e7faad86fdb9ad00597fe05af6920c533d9a6eb9d44ae27","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}